// Copy this file to Config/Local.xcconfig and put your own Apple team in it. That file is
// gitignored, so nobody's team identifier ends up in the repository.
//
// Without it the project still builds, with a warning that this configuration file is missing
// and a code signing error, because macOS will not sign an app for a team it has not been told
// about. Any Apple ID works, including a free one: sign in under Xcode > Settings > Accounts,
// then read the team from Signing & Capabilities.
//
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
